{"track":"tahsili","num":"6.01","slug":"limits-derivatives","title":"النهايات والاشتقاق","subtitle":"ClipSAT Printable Practice Suite (clipsat.org) • Topic 6.01 • 20 FRQs + 25 MCQs • Difficulty Progression • Cross-Lesson Synthesis","sections":[{"heading":"الجزء الأول — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): المهارات الأساسية (1–7)","questions":[{"q":"الشكل التالي يمثل منحنى $f(x)=x^2-2x$. أوجد معادلة خط المماس عند $x=3$ (النقطة المحددة).","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"خطوط المماس","answer":"$f(3)=9-6=3$. $f'(x)=2x-2$، إذن $f'(3)=4$. $y-3=4(x-3)\\Rightarrow y=4x-9$.","explanation":"$f(3)=9-6=3$. $f'(x)=2x-2$، إذن $f'(3)=4$. $y-3=4(x-3)\\Rightarrow y=4x-9$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["x**2-2*x"],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-2,"ymax":10,"points":[[3,3]],"width":220}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2}(3x^2-4x+1)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"الجزء الأول — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): المهارات الأساسية (1–7)","answer":"$3(4)-8+1=12-8+1=5$.","explanation":"$3(4)-8+1=12-8+1=5$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["1 + 1.5/(x - (-1))"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"asymptotes":{"x":[-1],"y":[1]},"point_labels":[{"x":0.5,"y":2,"label":"$( 0.5, 2 )$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3}\\frac{x^2-9}{x-3}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"الجزء الأول — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): المهارات الأساسية (1–7)","answer":"$\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3}=x+3\\rightarrow6$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3}=x+3\\rightarrow6$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["1 + 1.5/(x - (-1))"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"asymptotes":{"x":[-1],"y":[1]},"point_labels":[{"x":0.5,"y":2,"label":"$( 0.5, 2 )$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{3x^2+2x}{x^2-5}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"الجزء الثاني — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): تطبيقات متوسطة متعددة الخطوات (8–14)","answer":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $3$.","explanation":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $3$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["1 + 1.5/(x - (-1))"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"asymptotes":{"x":[-1],"y":[1]},"point_labels":[{"x":0.5,"y":2,"label":"$( 0.5, 2 )$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2}(3x^2-4x+1)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","answer":"$3(4)-8+1=12-8+1=5$.","explanation":"$3(4)-8+1=12-8+1=5$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow-1}(x^3+2x-5)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","answer":"$(-1)^3+2(-1)-5=-1-2-5=-8$.","explanation":"$(-1)^3+2(-1)-5=-1-2-5=-8$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["1 + 1.5/(x - (-1))"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"asymptotes":{"x":[-1],"y":[1]},"point_labels":[{"x":0.5,"y":2,"label":"$( 0.5, 2 )$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow0}\\frac{5x+7}{x+3}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","answer":"$\\frac{5(0)+7}{0+3}=\\frac{7}{3}$.","explanation":"$\\frac{5(0)+7}{0+3}=\\frac{7}{3}$."}]},{"heading":"الجزء الثاني — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): تطبيقات متوسطة متعددة الخطوات (8–14)","questions":[{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3}\\sqrt{x+13}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","answer":"$\\sqrt{3+13}=\\sqrt{16}=4$.","explanation":"$\\sqrt{3+13}=\\sqrt{16}=4$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3}\\frac{x^2-9}{x-3}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","answer":"$\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3}=x+3\\rightarrow6$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x-3)(x+3)}{x-3}=x+3\\rightarrow6$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow-2}\\frac{x^2+5x+6}{x+2}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","answer":"$\\frac{(x+2)(x+3)}{x+2}=x+3\\rightarrow1$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x+2)(x+3)}{x+2}=x+3\\rightarrow1$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow4}\\frac{x^2-16}{x-4}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","answer":"$\\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{x-4}=x+4\\rightarrow8$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{x-4}=x+4\\rightarrow8$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow1}\\frac{x^2-1}{x^2-3x+2}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","answer":"$\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{(x-1)(x-2)}=\\frac{x+1}{x-2}\\rightarrow\\frac{2}{-1}=-2$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{(x-1)(x-2)}=\\frac{x+1}{x-2}\\rightarrow\\frac{2}{-1}=-2$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{3x^2+2x}{x^2-5}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات عند اللانهاية","answer":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $3$.","explanation":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $3$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{2x+7}{x^2+1}$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات عند اللانهاية","answer":"درجة المقام أعلى، إذن النهاية تساوي $0$.","explanation":"درجة المقام أعلى، إذن النهاية تساوي $0$."}]},{"heading":"الجزء الثالث — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): مسائل التحدي والربط بين الدروس (15–20)","questions":[{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{5x^3-2}{x^3+4x}$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات عند اللانهاية","cross_lesson":"1.01 الجبر والمعادلات والمصفوفات","answer":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $5$.","explanation":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $5$."},{"q":"دالة معرّفة بـ $f(x)=x+1$ عندما $x<2$، و$f(x)=2x-1$ عندما $x\\geq2$. أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^-}f(x)$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات من جهة واحدة","cross_lesson":"2.01 الدوال وخصائصها والتحويلات الهندسية","answer":"باستخدام القاعدة الأولى: $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^-}f(x)=2+1=3$.","explanation":"باستخدام القاعدة الأولى: $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^-}f(x)=2+1=3$."},{"q":"باستخدام نفس الدالة المجزأة، أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^+}f(x)$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات من جهة واحدة","cross_lesson":"3.01 المتتابعات والمتسلسلات","answer":"باستخدام القاعدة الثانية: $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^+}f(x)=2(2)-1=3$.","explanation":"باستخدام القاعدة الثانية: $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2^+}f(x)=2(2)-1=3$."},{"q":"باستخدام نفس الدالة المجزأة، هل $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2}f(x)$ موجودة؟ اذكر قيمتها.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"النهايات من جهة واحدة","cross_lesson":"4.01 حساب المثلثات","answer":"نعم — كلتا النهايتين من الجهتين تساوي $3$، إذن $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2}f(x)=3$.","explanation":"نعم — كلتا النهايتين من الجهتين تساوي $3$، إذن $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow2}f(x)=3$."},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=x^5$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"قاعدة القوة","cross_lesson":"5.01 الهندسة الإحداثية والقطوع المخروطية","answer":"$f'(x)=5x^4$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=5x^4$."},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=3x^4-2x^2+7$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"FRQ","target":"قاعدة القوة","cross_lesson":"7.01 التكامل وتطبيقاته","answer":"$f'(x)=12x^3-4x$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=12x^3-4x$."}]},{"heading":"الجزء الرابع — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): إتقان المفاهيم الأساسية (21–28)","questions":[{"q":"يوضح الرسم البياني $f(x)=x^2-2x$، مع تحديد النقطة عند $x=3$. أوجد معادلة خط المماس هناك.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","choices":["$y=3x-9$","$y=4x-3$","$y=4x+9$","$y=4x-9$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$f(3)=3$، $f'(3)=4$: $y-3=4(x-3)\\Rightarrow y=4x-9$.","explanation":"$f(3)=3$، $f'(3)=4$: $y-3=4(x-3)\\Rightarrow y=4x-9$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["x**2-2*x"],"xmin":-1,"xmax":5,"ymin":-2,"ymax":10,"points":[[3,3]],"width":230}},{"q":"يوضح الرسم البياني $f(x)=x^2$ وخط مماسه عند $x=2$. أوجد ميل خط المماس بقراءة الرسم البياني.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","choices":["$4$","$2$","$1$","$8$"],"correct":0,"answer":"يرتفع خط المماس $4$ لكل $1$ أفقيًا.","explanation":"يرتفع خط المماس $4$ لكل $1$ أفقيًا.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["x**2","4*x-4"],"xmin":0,"xmax":4,"ymin":-1,"ymax":10,"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3}(2x^2-5x+3)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الرابع — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): إتقان المفاهيم الأساسية (21–28)","choices":["$12$","$-6$","$18$","$6$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$2(9)-5(3)+3=18-15+3=6$.","explanation":"$2(9)-5(3)+3=18-15+3=6$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["2 + 1.5/(x - (1))"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"asymptotes":{"x":[1],"y":[2]},"point_labels":[{"x":2.5,"y":3,"label":"$( 2.5, 3 )$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"اشتق $f(x)=\\frac{1}{x^3}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الرابع — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): إتقان المفاهيم الأساسية (21–28)","choices":["$-\\frac{3}{x^2}$","$-\\frac{3}{x^4}$","$\\frac{3}{x^4}$","$-\\frac{1}{3x^4}$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$f(x)=x^{-3}\\Rightarrow f'(x)=-3x^{-4}=-\\frac{3}{x^4}$.","explanation":"$f(x)=x^{-3}\\Rightarrow f'(x)=-3x^{-4}=-\\frac{3}{x^4}$.","figure":{"type":"plot","fns":["0.5*(x - (-1))**2 + (-1)","0.5*x + 1"],"xmin":-5,"xmax":5,"ymin":-4,"ymax":6,"point_labels":[{"x":-1,"y":-1,"label":"$(-1,-1)$"}],"width":230}},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3}(2x^2-5x+3)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة القوة","choices":["$12$","$-6$","$18$","$6$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$2(9)-5(3)+3=18-15+3=6$.","explanation":"$2(9)-5(3)+3=18-15+3=6$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow4}\\frac{x^2-3x}{2x+1}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة الضرب","choices":["$\\frac{4}{7}$","$\\frac{16}{9}$","$\\frac{4}{8}$","$\\frac{4}{9}$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$\\frac{16-12}{9}=\\frac{4}{9}$.","explanation":"$\\frac{16-12}{9}=\\frac{4}{9}$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow-1}\\frac{x^2-1}{x^2+3x+2}$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة السلسلة","choices":["$-2$","$2$","$-1$","$-\\frac{1}{2}$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\rightarrow\\frac{x-1}{x+2}=\\frac{-2}{1}=-2$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{(x+1)(x+2)}\\rightarrow\\frac{x-1}{x+2}=\\frac{-2}{1}=-2$."},{"q":"دالة معرّفة بـ$f(x)=x+2$ لـ$x<3$، و$f(x)=3x-4$ لـ$x\\geq3$. أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow3^-}f(x)$.","difficulty":"Foundational","question_type":"MCQ","target":"مشتقات الدوال المثلثية والأسية","choices":["$3$","$4$","$9$","$5$"],"correct":3,"answer":"باستخدام $x<3$: $f(x)\\rightarrow3+2=5$.","explanation":"باستخدام $x<3$: $f(x)\\rightarrow3+2=5$."}]},{"heading":"الجزء الخامس — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): تطبيقات الاختبار المتوسطة (29–37)","questions":[{"q":"اشتق $f(x)=x^7$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"خطوط المماس","choices":["$x^6$","$7x^8$","$6x^7$","$7x^6$"],"correct":3,"answer":"قاعدة القوة: $7x^{7-1}=7x^6$.","explanation":"قاعدة القوة: $7x^{7-1}=7x^6$."},{"q":"اشتق $f(x)=x^3(2x+5)$ باستخدام قاعدة الضرب.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"التزايد والتناقص والمشتقة الثانية","choices":["$8x^3+15x^2$","$6x^2+5$","$8x^3+5x^2$","$2x^3+15x^2$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$f'(x)=3x^2(2x+5)+x^3(2)=6x^3+15x^2+2x^3=8x^3+15x^2$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=3x^2(2x+5)+x^3(2)=6x^3+15x^2+2x^3=8x^3+15x^2$."},{"q":"اشتق $f(x)=(2x+3)^5$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"مسائل لفظية: معدلات التغير","choices":["$5(2x+3)^4$","$2(2x+3)^4$","$10(2x+3)^5$","$10(2x+3)^4$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$f'(x)=5(2x+3)^4\\cdot2=10(2x+3)^4$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=5(2x+3)^4\\cdot2=10(2x+3)^4$."},{"q":"اشتق $f(x)=\\cos x-\\sin x$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الأول — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): المهارات الأساسية (1–7)","choices":["$\\sin x+\\cos x$","$-\\sin x-\\cos x$","$\\sin x-\\cos x$","$-\\sin x+\\cos x$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$\\frac{d}{dx}[\\cos x]=-\\sin x$، $\\frac{d}{dx}[-\\sin x]=-\\cos x$.","explanation":"$\\frac{d}{dx}[\\cos x]=-\\sin x$، $\\frac{d}{dx}[-\\sin x]=-\\cos x$."},{"q":"أوجد ميل خط المماس لـ$f(x)=x^2$ عند $x=4$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الثاني — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): تطبيقات متوسطة متعددة الخطوات (8–14)","choices":["$4$","$2$","$16$","$8$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$f'(x)=2x$؛ $f'(4)=8$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=2x$؛ $f'(4)=8$."},{"q":"أوجد المشتقة الثانية لـ$f(x)=x^5-3x^3$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الثالث — أسئلة مقالية (FRQs): مسائل التحدي والربط بين الدروس (15–20)","choices":["$20x^2-18x$","$20x^3-18x$","$20x^3-9x$","$5x^4-9x^2$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$f'(x)=5x^4-9x^2$؛ $f''(x)=20x^3-18x$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=5x^4-9x^2$؛ $f''(x)=20x^3-18x$."},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow-5}(-3x^2-5x+4)$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الرابع — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): إتقان المفاهيم الأساسية (21–28)","choices":["$-49$","$-43$","$46$","$-46$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$-3(-5)^2+25+4=-46$.","explanation":"$-3(-5)^2+25+4=-46$."},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=x^5$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الخامس — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): تطبيقات الاختبار المتوسطة (29–37)","choices":["$x^5$","$5x^4$","$6x^4$","$5x^5$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$f'(x)=5x^4$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=5x^4$."},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=4\\sin x$.","difficulty":"Intermediate","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء السادس — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): مسائل التحدي والربط بين الدروس (38–45)","choices":["$4\\sin x$","$-4\\cos x$","$4\\cos x$","$5\\cos x$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$f'(x)=4\\cos x$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=4\\cos x$."}]},{"heading":"الجزء السادس — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): مسائل التحدي والربط بين الدروس (38–45)","questions":[{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow-4}\\frac{x^2+9x+20}{x+4}$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتعويض المباشر","choices":["$1$","$3$","$4$","$-1$"],"correct":0,"answer":"$\\frac{(x+4)(x+5)}{x+4}=x+5\\rightarrow1$.","explanation":"$\\frac{(x+4)(x+5)}{x+4}=x+5\\rightarrow1$.","cross_lesson":"4.01 حساب المثلثات"},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=(-2x+1)(x+2)$ باستخدام قاعدة الضرب.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"حساب النهايات بالتحليل (الصورة 0/0)","choices":["$4x-3$","$-4x-3$","$-4x-1$","$-4x+3$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$f'(x)=(-2)(x+2)+(-2x+1)(1)=-2x-4-2x+1=-4x-3$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=(-2)(x+2)+(-2x+1)(1)=-2x-4-2x+1=-4x-3$.","cross_lesson":"5.01 الهندسة الإحداثية والقطوع المخروطية"},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=(3x-5)(-2x-1)$ باستخدام قاعدة الضرب.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"النهايات عند اللانهاية","choices":["$-12x+9$","$-12x-7$","$12x+7$","$-12x+7$"],"correct":3,"answer":"$f'(x)=(3)(-2x-1)+(3x-5)(-2)=-6x-3-6x+10=-12x+7$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=(3)(-2x-1)+(3x-5)(-2)=-6x-3-6x+10=-12x+7$.","cross_lesson":"7.01 التكامل وتطبيقاته"},{"q":"أوجد مشتقة $f(x)=(3x+1)^{5}$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"النهايات من جهة واحدة","choices":["$18(3x+1)^4$","$15(3x+1)^5$","$15(3x+1)^4$","$5(3x+1)^4$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$f'(x)=5(3x+1)^{4}(3)=15(3x+1)^4$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=5(3x+1)^{4}(3)=15(3x+1)^4$.","cross_lesson":"8.01 الدوال الأسية واللوغاريتمية"},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{4x^2-8x}{2x^2-8}$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة القوة","choices":["$2$","$\\frac{1}{2}$","$3$","$0$"],"correct":0,"answer":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $2$.","explanation":"الدرجتان متساويتان، إذن النهاية هي نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين: $2$.","cross_lesson":"9.01 الإحصاء والاحتمالات"},{"q":"أوجد معادلة خط المماس لـ $f(x)=-2x^2-4x-1$ عند $x=-2$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة الضرب","choices":["$y=-4x+7$","$y=4x-7$","$y=4x+7$","$y=4x+10$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$f(-2)=-1$, $f'(-2)=4$. $y-(-1)=4(x-(-2))\\Rightarrow y=4x+7$.","explanation":"$f(-2)=-1$, $f'(-2)=4$. $y-(-1)=4(x-(-2))\\Rightarrow y=4x+7$.","cross_lesson":"1.01 الجبر والمعادلات والمصفوفات"},{"q":"أوجد المشتقة الثانية لـ $f(x)=-2x^4-5x^2$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"قاعدة السلسلة","choices":["$-22x^2-10$","$24x^2-10$","$-24x^2-10$","$-24x^2+10$"],"correct":2,"answer":"$f'(x)=-8x^3-10x$, so $f''(x)=-24x^2-10$.","explanation":"$f'(x)=-8x^3-10x$, so $f''(x)=-24x^2-10$.","cross_lesson":"2.01 الدوال وخصائصها والتحويلات الهندسية"},{"q":"أوجد $\\lim_{x\\rightarrow0}(-2x^2+x-2)$.","difficulty":"Challenging","question_type":"MCQ","target":"الجزء الخامس — اختيار من متعدد (MCQs): تطبيقات الاختبار المتوسطة (29–37)","choices":["$1$","$-2$","$2$","$-5$"],"correct":1,"answer":"$-2(0)^2-2=-2$.","explanation":"$-2(0)^2-2=-2$.","cross_lesson":"3.01 المتتابعات والمتسلسلات"}]}],"lang":"ar"}